      "id": "cvpr26-975f144a9915",
      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. The WeDetect model family: (a) WeDetect is an open-vocabulary object detector with a dual-tower architecture without any multi-modal fusion layers. (b) WeDetect-Uni is a universal proposal generator whose parameters are shared with WeDetect except for a learnable objectness prompt for classification. (c) WeDetect-Ref is an LLM-Based REC model, which can retrieve target objects from proposals provided by WeDetect-Uni corresponding to user-provided expressions.",
