      "caption": "Figure 4 : Our Proposed Continual Learning Approach via Fairness DPO for Large Multimodal Models . Traditional reinforcement learning with human feedback (RLHF) method optimize models through explicit reward maximization. Our framework instead reformulates RLHF as Direct Preference Optimization (DPO). The Fairness DPO loss mitigate the gradient biased under the imbalanced data.",
