      "id": "cvpr26-250927cf6443",
      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. The STAMP Pipeline. Phase 1 (Dialogue Generation): The MLLM autoregressively generates a conversational response, emitting a special <SEG> token to trigger mask generation. Phase 2 (All-mask Generation): Triggered by the <SEG> token, a sequence of [MASK] placeholders, each fused with its corresponding image patch feature, is processed. A single non-autoregressive forward pass with hybrid attention then predicts all mask tokens simultaneously.",
