      "caption": "Figure 8 : 𝒟 compact \\mathcal{D}_{\\text{compact}} architecture. The proposed 𝒟 compact \\mathcal{D}_{\\text{compact}} is based on MM-DiT [ 18 ] , a DiT [ 55 ] variant designed for multimodal input processing.\nThe architecture consists of two parallel processing streams: one for compact latent tokens 𝒛 {\\bm{z}} and another for target latent tokens 𝒛 ψ {\\bm{z}}^{\\psi} , which are fused through self attention over the concatenated token sequence. For the overall depiction of CompACT, we refer to Fig. 2 in the main paper.",
