      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3 : Framework Overview : We obtain training data through two complementary approaches: (i) Event Data Factory : SVRaster [ 59 ] generates synthetic event stereo pairs and depth labels from sparse RGB images via virtual camera trajectories (left); (ii) Stereo Cross-Modal Distillation : existing RGB stereo models produce proxy depth labels for real event data in calibrated RGB-Event stereo setups (top right). (iii) Both data sources are combined in EventHub to train/adapt event stereo networks (bottom right).",
