      "caption": "Figure 1 : CryoHype architecture . An input image X i X_{i} of an unknown structure is first tokenized and concatenated with learnable weight tokens. All tokens are then processed with a transformer encoder, and the output weight tokens are used to modify the weights of an implicit neural representation (INR) that reconstructs the structure V i V_{i} .",
