      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3 : Overview of VGGDrive . Specifically, the frozen visual 3D foundation model (VGGT [ 39 ] ) extracts geometrically consistent 3D features V 3 ​ d V^{3d} through cross-view analysis, while the base VLM is decomposed into multiple decoder layers. The proposed CVGE sequentially integrates the shared 3D features V 3 ​ d V^{3d} with the 2D visual representations V i 2 ​ d V_{i}^{2d} , injecting them V i 3 ​ d V_{i}^{3d} through a hierarchical adaptive mechanism, thereby establishing geometric grounding and enabling deep enhancement of the VLM architecture.",
