      "id": "cvpr26-6a27b2c3b53a",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of COLOR. Our framework introduces a complete two-stage training paradigm and a consistent retrieval-based feature encoder. Solid lines denote stage one, while dashed lines represent stage two. We first partition pixels into multi-view and single-view sets, which are trained in stage one and stage two, respectively. Concurrently, our retrieval-oriented training for the local encoder ensures its consistency with the global encoder.",
