      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of the DiT360 hybrid training pipeline. For the perspective branch, we employ (a) perspective image re-projection to transfer perspective knowledge to panoramic domain. For the panoramic branch, we first apply (b) panoramic refinement to remove polar blurring and then introduce (c) position-aware circular padding, (d) rotation-consistent yaw loss and (e) distortion-aware cube loss for token-level hybrid supervision.",
