      "caption": "Figure 2. The pipeline of GS-ASM. The 2DGS model renders IR images in no-projection mode to generate disparity proxy labels from depth maps for proxy-supervision. Its rendered novel views (with depth maps) undergo the Pinhole Camera Model for data augmentation. The active stereo matching network utilizes IR images and binary projection patterns for reprojection, employing joint training through disparity supervision and reprojection loss.",
