      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of our method. (a) Extraction pipeline of segment-level STS features. (b) Structure of the SG-TFM module, where Temporal Script Attention introduces control signals. (c) Bi-Frame Sound Synthesis Framework, which leverages the controllability of our method in T2A and V2A to enable parallel rendering of in-frame and out-of-frame sounds. Fused block represents the single-modal transformer block in MMAudio.",
