      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Architecture of 1D variable-length video tokenizer for EVATok. The input video is spatio-temporally patchified into 3D embeddings. According to a given assignment a, 1D variable- length query embeddings are initialized from these 3D embed- dings. After Q-Former encoding and quantization, 1D discrete tokens are produced. Finally, 3D queries are initialized to recon- struct the video frames from the 1D tokens.",
