      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3 : Overview of our LTS-FS framework. First, we build a bi-granularity dataset with token-level and sentence-level hallucinations. Then, using the dataset, hallucination-relevant layers are identified via intervention-based attribution. Finally, a layerwise strategy is applied to control the feature steering intensity across layers according to the attribution scores.",
