      "id": "cvpr26-168cce64dcb5",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. The flowchart of the proposed BRGMAR framework. BRGMAR learns the image representations via the vision-language foundation model CONCH [34]. For the ST data, BRGMAR utilizes a Dynamic Multi-Relational Graph Learning (DMRGL) module to delineate their complex dependencies. In addition, to leverage the patient-level diagnostic information from the bulk-RNA seq, an optimal transportation-based gene module alignment approach is proposed. Finally, we fuse the representations from both ST and pathological images to facilitate accurate AR detection.",
      "page": 4,
      "captionRect": [
