      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overall framework of DeformPIC. Our model consists of two core components. The Deformation Extraction Network (DEN) extracts the geometric transformation from an example pair (prompt input→prompt target) into a task embedding. This embedding then modulates the Deformation Transfer Network (DTN), thereby guiding it to apply the same transformation to a new query input to produce the final predi